{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["准绳"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又举目观看，见有人拿着准绳。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["于是我问：“你要去哪里？”他回答说：“去丈量耶路撒冷，看看有多宽多长。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["此前与我说话的天使离去时，另一位天使迎着他走来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["对他说：“快跑去告诉那青年，‘耶路撒冷必像没有城墙限制的村庄，因为里面的人和牲畜太多了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华说，我要成为一堵火墙环绕耶路撒冷，作城中的荣耀。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["“耶和华说，‘快快逃离北方之地吧！因为我曾把你们分散到天下四方，这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住在巴比伦城的人啊，快逃到锡安吧！’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["万军之耶和华为了彰显祂的荣耀，差遣我去那些掳掠你们的国家，因为谁动你们，就是动祂的瞳仁。祂说："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["“看啊，我要出手攻击他们，使他们被自己的奴隶掳掠。那时你们便知道是万军之耶和华差遣了我。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华说：“少女锡安啊，高声欢唱吧！因为我要来住在你里面。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["到那天，许多国家都要归向耶和华，做祂的子民。祂要住在你们当中。那时你们便知道，是万军之耶和华差遣我到你们这里来的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和华必拥有犹大作祂圣地的产业，祂必再次拣选耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["世人都当在耶和华面前肃静，因为祂要从圣所起身行动。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}